          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When a muscle cell is stimulated, calcium ions are released from the sarcoplasmic reticulum.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 2
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "With reference to Fig. 1.1, describe the role of calcium ions in the contraction of the sarcomere.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 2
            }
          }
        ],
